{
  "name": "Facebook Reel - Draft Upload (gfootage -> Go Go Bud)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "n1-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Facebook Reel - Draft Upload\n\nDIBUAT 2026-08-24, BELUM PERNAH DIUJI LIVE (gogobuda offline saat dirakit).\nBaca `workflows/README.md` sebelum jalan pertama kali - ada 2 kredensial\nyang WAJIB diisi manual dulu, dan Page ID di-hardcode di 2 node (cari\n`896095410254698`).\n\nAlur: ambil Reel TERBARU dari `gfootage:VN-exports/` (rclone, remote\ntambahan yg disambung 2026-08-24) -> upload ke Meta Reels Publishing API\ndgn `video_state=DRAFT` (TIDAK auto-publish - masuk Page sbg draft utk\ndireview manual sebelum tayang).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "n0-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "rclone lsjson gfootage:VN-exports/ --files-only"
      },
      "id": "n2-list",
      "name": "List VN-exports",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1180, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const stdout = $input.first().json.stdout;\nlet files;\ntry {\n  files = JSON.parse(stdout);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Gagal parse output rclone lsjson: ' + stdout);\n}\nconst videos = files.filter(f => f.Name.toLowerCase().endsWith('.mp4'));\nif (videos.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('Tidak ada file .mp4 di gfootage:VN-exports/ - jalankan pipeline konten (viral_analyzer -> RN7) dulu sebelum trigger workflow ini.');\n}\nvideos.sort((a, b) => new Date(b.ModTime) - new Date(a.ModTime));\nconst chosen = videos[0];\nconst base = chosen.Name.replace(/\\.mp4$/i, '');\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    videoName: chosen.Name,\n    captionName: base + '.story-script.md',\n    baseName: base,\n    modTime: chosen.ModTime\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "n3-pick",
      "name": "Pick Latest Reel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-960, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=mkdir -p /app/output && rclone copy \"gfootage:VN-exports/{{$json[\"videoName\"]}}\" /app/output/"
      },
      "id": "n4-copyvideo",
      "name": "Copy Video Locally",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-740, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=rclone copy \"gfootage:VN-exports/{{$json[\"captionName\"]}}\" /app/output/ 2>/dev/null; exit 0"
      },
      "id": "n5-copycaption",
      "name": "Copy Caption Locally",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, 220],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=cat \"/app/output/{{$node[\"Pick Latest Reel\"].json[\"captionName\"]}}\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"Konten baru dari Go Go Bud - draft otomatis, mohon direview sebelum publish.\""
      },
      "id": "n6-readcaption",
      "name": "Read Caption Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "fileSelector": "=/app/output/{{$node[\"Pick Latest Reel\"].json[\"videoName\"]}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n7-readvideo",
      "name": "Read Video File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-80, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v20.0/896095410254698/video_reels",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "upload_phase", "value": "start"}
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpQueryAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n8-fbstart",
      "name": "FB: Start Upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-740, 540],
      "credentials": {
        "httpQueryAuth": {
          "id": "TO_BE_LINKED",
          "name": "Facebook Graph API Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combinationMode": "mergeByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n9-merge",
      "name": "Merge Video+UploadURL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [140, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$json[\"upload_url\"]}}",
        "sendBinaryData": true,
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "offset", "value": "0"},
            {"name": "file_size", "value": "={{$binary.data.fileSize}}"}
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n10-fbupload",
      "name": "FB: Upload Binary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [360, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "TO_BE_LINKED",
          "name": "Facebook Reels Upload OAuth Header"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v20.0/896095410254698/video_reels",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "upload_phase", "value": "finish"},
            {"name": "video_id", "value": "={{$node[\"FB: Start Upload\"].json[\"video_id\"]}}"},
            {"name": "video_state", "value": "DRAFT"},
            {"name": "description", "value": "={{$node[\"Read Caption Text\"].json[\"stdout\"]}}"}
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpQueryAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n11-fbfinish",
      "name": "FB: Finish Upload (Draft)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [580, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "httpQueryAuth": {
          "id": "TO_BE_LINKED",
          "name": "Facebook Graph API Token"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [[{"node": "List VN-exports", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "List VN-exports": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Pick Latest Reel", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Pick Latest Reel": {
      "main": [[
        {"node": "Copy Video Locally", "type": "main", "index": 0},
        {"node": "FB: Start Upload", "type": "main", "index": 0}
      ]]
    },
    "Copy Video Locally": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Copy Caption Locally", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Copy Caption Locally": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Read Caption Text", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Read Caption Text": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Read Video File", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Read Video File": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Merge Video+UploadURL", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "FB: Start Upload": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Merge Video+UploadURL", "type": "main", "index": 1}]]
    },
    "Merge Video+UploadURL": {
      "main": [[{"node": "FB: Upload Binary", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "FB: Upload Binary": {
      "main": [[{"node": "FB: Finish Upload (Draft)", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
